  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GHana - Anti-Corruption, Rule of Law and Accountability Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programmes overall objective is to promote good governance in Ghana by reducing corruption and improving accountability and compliance with the rule of law, particularly when it comes to anti-corruption, accountability and environmental governance. Its specific objective is to contribute to current reform processes in the area of rule of law, accountability, anti-corruption and environmental governance through support to key institutions, while at the same time increasing the ability of the</narrative>
  </description>
